# Housing Scheme App Guidance

- Domain: Cyprus housing-lot allocation workflow based on `requirements/`.
- Stack: Django + PostgreSQL (production) and SQLite (local development).
- Code and identifiers must be in English.
- End-user UI labels and workflow text must be in Greek.
- Keep section references (for example `10.4.6`) in model/form `help_text` when a field maps directly to the specification.
- New work belongs in `stegastiko/` and must not modify the legacy prototype under `Στεγαστικό_Λευκωσίας_Codex (1)/` unless explicitly requested.
